[size=12pt][b][u]Update[/u][/b][/size]
    Hi folks, apologies for such a delay in updating about this project. I've had a lot of significant changes in my personal life recently that have kept me from the forums more than I'd like.
    The X2UP is still in progress! Currently, I'm working on my (now slightly late) 10th anniversary surprise for the community. This isn't the X2UP itself, but it is something that will factor into the release of the X2UP. I'm hoping to get this out ASAP. I have also slightly changed the roadmap of the X2UP. Originally, I was planning to update the skins of 10 characters that I had worked on a long time ago to my more modern standard. I've decided to delay those plans for all but 1 character (Cyclops) until after the initial release of the X2UP. This will allow me to focus on the new releases that will bring the project to completion. Once the initial release of the X2UP is complete, I'll turn my attention to updating all of my older skin releases.